OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785766710
OL,3,CTrump says new negotiations with Iran
OL,4,Cto begin on Monday
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has said
OL,7,Fnegotiations with Iran will start on
OL,8,FMonday, after he called off new
OL,9,Fstrikes on the country over the
OL,10,Fweekend.
OL,12,FTrump had said a plan was in place for
OL,13,FUS forces to carry out "the biggest
OL,14,Fattack since World War II" on Sunday.
OL,16,FBut in a post on Truth Social, Trump
OL,17,Fsaid he had been asked to "hold off"
OL,18,Fon attacks by Iran and other key Gulf
OL,19,Fleaders, as the "perimeters of a deal
OL,20,Fhave been agreed to".
OL,26,@uD@XOUvD@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
