OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785766710
OL,3,CTrump says new negotiations with Iran
OL,4,Cto begin on Monday
OL,6,FSpeaking on Air Force One on Sunday,
OL,7,FTrump told reporters: "They said we'd
OL,8,Flike to make a deal.
OL,10,F"Now, you know, I don't know what they
OL,11,Fsay because a lot of times they'll say
OL,12,Fthat to me and then they'll go out and
OL,13,Fsay, we don't know what he's talking
OL,14,Fabout.
OL,16,F"Obviously they don't want to be
OL,17,Fattacked. And they knew, they knew the
OL,18,Fextent of the attack because they saw
OL,19,Fit for me."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785766710
OL,3,CTrump says new negotiations with Iran
OL,4,Cto begin on Monday
OL,6,FHe continued: "Now what we're doing is
OL,7,Fwe're talking to them in the form of a
OL,8,Fnegotiation. It begins tomorrow
OL,9,Fafternoon."
OL,11,FOn Sunday, Trump reiterated that the
OL,12,Femerging deal would include a
OL,13,Freopening of the Strait of Hormuz, the
OL,14,Fcritical waterway where about a fifth
OL,15,Fof all traded oil and natural gas
OL,16,Fflowed before the start of the war,
OL,17,Fand would resolve US concerns about
OL,18,FIran's nuclear programme.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785766710
OL,3,CTrump says new negotiations with Iran
OL,4,Cto begin on Monday
OL,6,FThe US, in exchange, will end its
OL,7,Fnaval blockade on Iran and allow
OL,8,FTehran to export its oil as stated in
OL,9,Fthe tentative ceasefire deal, a
OL,10,Fregional official involved in the
OL,11,Fmediation efforts said.
OL,13,FTrump said that Israel is joining his
OL,14,Fcommitment to end the war by
OL,15,Fimplementing the ceasefire deal
OL,16,Freached in June. Israel did not
OL,17,Fpublicly comment on the announcement.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
