PN,31505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785766710
OL,3,CTrump says new negotiations with Iran
OL,4,Cto begin on Monday
OL,6,FIran has repeatedly attacked vessels
OL,7,Fattempting to transit through the
OL,8,FStrait of Hormuz without its
OL,9,Fauthorisation as part of its conflict
OL,10,Fwith the US.
OL,12,FIran's Foreign Ministry spokesperson
OL,13,FEsmail Baghaei said on Sunday that the
OL,14,FStrait of Hormuz "will in no way
OL,15,Freturn to the status it was before
OL,16,FFebruary 28th," the day the war
OL,17,Fstarted.
OL,26,@vD@ROUxD@OO]
