PN,31506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785766710
OL,3,CTrump says new negotiations with Iran
OL,4,Cto begin on Monday
OL,6,FOn a call with Iranian state TV, he
OL,7,Fadded that Iran is discussing shipping
OL,8,Fthrough the strait with Oman, on the
OL,9,Fother side of Hormuz, but that there's
OL,10,Fno current talk about reopening the
OL,11,Fcrucial waterway.
OL,13,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,18,FTrump has announced halts to strikes
OL,19,Fon Iran on several occasions since the
OL,20,FUnited States and Israel attacked Iran
OL,21,Fon February 28 earlier this year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
