PN,31507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785766710
OL,3,CTrump says new negotiations with Iran
OL,4,Cto begin on Monday
OL,6,FIran's defence minister said on X that
OL,7,Fthe country was "neither surprised nor
OL,8,Fpassive" following Trump's
OL,9,Fannouncement and said the Islamic
OL,10,FRepublic remains alert in the face of
OL,11,Fconcrete threats from the US.
OL,13,FSaudi Arabia's Crown Prince Mohammed
OL,14,Fbin Salman raised concerns about the
OL,15,FUS potentially escalating the conflict
OL,16,Fwhen he spoke with Trump by phone on
OL,17,FSaturday.
OL,26,@oD@QOUpD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
