PN,31508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785766710
OL,3,CTrump says new negotiations with Iran
OL,4,Cto begin on Monday
OL,6,FThe call was "candid and
OL,7,Fconstructive," according to a person
OL,8,Fbriefed on the call who was not
OL,9,Fauthorised to comment publicly and
OL,10,Frequested anonymity.
OL,12,FThe crown prince conveyed that an
OL,13,Fescalation in fighting could have a
OL,14,Fsevere impact on the global economy if
OL,15,FTehran responded to a new US
OL,16,Fbombardment by targeting some of the
OL,17,FUnited States' Gulf allies.
OL,26,@nD@NOUoD@NO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
