PN,31509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785766710
OL,3,CTrump says new negotiations with Iran
OL,4,Cto begin on Monday
OL,6,FTrump suggested that his conversation
OL,7,Fwith the Saudi crown prince weighed
OL,8,Fheavily in his decision to halt his
OL,9,Fplans to carry out strikes on Iran.
OL,11,F"It would have been disastrous for
OL,12,Fthem. And they didn't want us to do
OL,13,Fit," Trump said. "And frankly, Saudi
OL,14,FArabia didn't want it either. They
OL,15,Fthought that a deal is imminent."
OL,26,@sD@AOUwD@aO]
